flowchart TD
A[Manager Publish Master Plan] --> B[Create Sub Plans]
B --> C[Editor Open Workbench]
C --> D[Run Calculation]
D --> E{Material Enough}
E -- Yes --> F[Confirm Sub Plan]
E -- No --> G[Short and Backorder]
G --> H[Open Control Tower]
H --> I[Record ETA]
I --> J[Run Replan]
J --> K[Update Plan]
F --> L[Open Trace]
K --> L
L --> M[Check Movement]
M --> N[Close UAT]

P1[Page BOM] --> AP1[API BOM]
AP1 --> DB1[DB BOM Tables]
P2[Page Planning] --> AP2[API Planning]
AP2 --> DB2[DB Plan Tables]
AP2 --> DB3[DB Snapshot Tables]
P3[Page Control Tower] --> AP3[API Control Tower]
AP3 --> DB2
AP3 --> GW1[Gateway PO ETA and Stock]
P4[Page Trace] --> AP4[API Trace]
AP4 --> DB2
AP4 --> GW2[Gateway Movement Log]
